flowchart TD
  E[Authorized Studio entry] --> DATA[Recipient, programme, date, status]
  DATA --> SIGN[Trainer and signatory records]
  DATA --> NUM[Unique MLVA certificate number]
  NUM --> PDF[Certificate PDF generation]
  SIGN --> PDF
  DATA --> TOKEN[Verification token]
  TOKEN --> QR[QR verification link]
  PDF --> DL[Downloaded branded PDF]
  QR --> VERIFY[Public /verify route]
  VERIFY --> API[Certificate verification Function]
  API --> LOOKUP[Validated, rate-limited lookup]
  LOOKUP --> LAKE[(Sanity certificate record)]
  LAKE --> RESULT[Valid or revoked result]